# Requests individually run karo, "Run All" nahi. Cloud changes assistant execute nahi karta.
# Key ko HTTP client's private environment mein qdrantApiKey variable ke naam se set karo; commit mat karo.
# Existing collection reuse ho sakti hai. Nayi shared collection banane par old vectors migrate/re-ingest karne honge.
# Pehle actual source manual ka model/year verify karo; bike name alone applicability prove nahi karta.
@qdrantUrl = https://YOUR-CLUSTER.cloud.qdrant.io:6333
@collection = X440_Manual
@manualKey = harley-x440-2024-owner-v1

### 1. Exact-match filtering ke liye manual_key keyword index
PUT {{qdrantUrl}}/collections/{{collection}}/index?wait=true
api-key: {{qdrantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "field_name": "manual_key",
  "field_schema": "keyword"
}

### 2. Existing points inspect karo; source verify karke IDs collect karo
# result.next_page_offset non-null ho toh next request mein offset field add karke page continue karo.
POST {{qdrantUrl}}/collections/{{collection}}/points/scroll
api-key: {{qdrantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "limit": 100,
  "with_payload": true,
  "with_vector": false
}

### 3. Sirf verified manual ke point IDs par key add karo; text/vectors preserve rahenge
# Placeholder ko actual IDs se replace karo. Numeric IDs bina quotes, UUIDs string ke roop mein.
# Collection-wide unfiltered update mat karna; doosre manuals galat label ho sakte hain.
POST {{qdrantUrl}}/collections/{{collection}}/points/payload?wait=true
api-key: {{qdrantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payload": {
    "manual_key": "{{manualKey}}"
  },
  "points": ["REPLACE_WITH_VERIFIED_POINT_ID"]
}

### 4. Tagged passages verify karo; SQL MasterBikes.ManualKey mein exactly yahi string set karo
POST {{qdrantUrl}}/collections/{{collection}}/points/scroll
api-key: {{qdrantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "limit": 100,
  "with_payload": true,
  "with_vector": false,
  "filter": {
    "must": [
      { "key": "manual_key", "match": { "value": "{{manualKey}}" } }
    ]
  }
}
